fixture cam_double_jump_ledge
doc camera review (docs/adr/0011): the same double jump in place on the camera room's 1920 u ledge (not at the room's bottom clamp)
room test/camera
spawn 900 1920
frames 150
input
  0..28 jump
  29 jump !jump
  30..60 jump
end
expect
  at 0 event.jump=1
  at 29 event.air_jump=1
  mark land 30..149 event.land=1
  at land y=1920u
end
